    // 🔄 REFILL SYSTEM — available once an order is Complete AND the
    // package was marked refillable by Admin. A 24-hour cooldown applies
    // after completion before a refill can actually be requested, then
    // Admin reviews and approves/denies it (same review pattern as Cancel
