/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   v34 USER · PART 9 — PROFESSIONAL SUPPORT DESK   (English only)
   The old flow just fired a small toast and left the user on the form.
   Now:
     • Priority selector (admin-controlled)
     • Optional screenshot / proof link
     • Expected first-reply time shown before and after submitting
